      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *  PAGE LOAD CONTROL METHOD                                                                                                                                                                       
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       method-id Page_Load is protected.                                                                                                                                                                
       procedure division using by value param-sender as object                                                                                                                                         
                                         param-e as type System.EventArgs.                                                                                                                              
            Set CheckOfflineClass to New Type IdealRoutines.CheckOffLineClass.
            Invoke CheckOffLineClass::CheckOffline(CkTranCode, CkRedirect, CkMessage)
            set OffLine::Text to CkMessage.
            If CkRedirect not = spaces 
                Invoke Self::Response::Redirect(CkRedirect::Trim)
            End-If.
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * If this is a POSTBACK from the screen then collect the screen data                                                                                                                              
      * and prepare the program data areas and return to the program and wait                                                                                                                           
      * for the program to send the next screen                                                                                                                                                         
      * (it moves the data from the screen to the program areas)                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                          
              INVOKE Self::"From_Screen".                                                                                                                                                               
.                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * Program has sent a new screen and we have arrived here                                                                                                                                          
      * by a screen redirection                                                                                                                                                                         
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * or the program has return to redisplay the same screen                                                                                                                                          
      * (ie - fall through from above "Fron Screen")                                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * either way ---                                                                                                                                                                                  
      *     populate the screen fields from the                                                                                                                                                         
      *     program data areas and send to the terminal                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * (it move the data from the program areas to the screen)                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"To_Screen".                                                                                                                                                                    
`                                                                                                                                                                                                       
       end method Page_Load.                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *  LOGIC TO UNLOAD THE FIELDS FROM THE SCREEN                                                                                                                                                     
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       method-id.  From_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                               
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * GET SESSION-NUMBER FROM SCREEN                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF NOT Self::IsPostBack 
              MOVE SPACES TO REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION 
               SET REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO Self::Request::QueryString::Item("SESSION") 
              IF REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION NOT = SPACES 
                 MOVE REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO THIS-SESSION-ALPHA 
              END-IF 
           ELSE 
              SET THIS-SESSION-ALPHA TO UCTSESSION::"Value" 
           END-IF.                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * READ THE PASSING PARAMETERS FROM THE PASSING FILE.                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE "R"          TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE THIS-SESSION TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE SPACES       TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                       
           MOVE ZERO         TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                        
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                                  
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NULL.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE PASS-SESSION-DATA    TO PCIM-FILE-AREA.                                                                                                                                                 
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-DATA       TO D158700-REC.                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-CURSOR     TO D158700-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                 
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES TO D158700-ATTR.                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-TEMP       TO D158700-TEMP.                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ERROR      TO D158700-ERROR.                                                                                                                                                  
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED   TO D158700-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * MOVE SCREEN CHARACTERS TO PROGRAM VARIABLES                                                                                                                                                     
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
           IF NOT Self::IsPostBack 
              IF PCIM-FILE-REFRESH NOT = 1 
                 INVOKE Self::"Pcim_Data_To_Output" 
                 EXIT METHOD 
              END-IF 
           END-IF. 
           IF PCIM-FILE-REFRESH = 1 
              GO TO REFRESH-ROUTINE 
           END-IF.                                                                                                                                                                                                  
           INVOKE Self::"Unload_Screen".                                                                                                                                                                
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * CHECK FOR SCREEN CONTROL CHARACTERS                                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Pfkeys".                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * CLEAR THE TEMPORARY FIELD ATTRIBUTES                                                                                                                                                            
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Clear_Temp_Attributes".                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * PERFORM THE FIELD VALIDATION RULES                                                                                                                                                              
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Validation_Rules".                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET THE FIELD CURSOR FLAG                                                                                                                                                                       
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Set_Field_Cursor_Flag".                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * CALL PCIM TO WRITE INPUT-DATA TO SCREEN FILE                                                                                                                                                    
      * AND WAIT FOR NEXT SCREEN.                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE THIS-SESSION     TO PCIM-FILE-KEY.                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE "R"              TO PCIM-FILE-CODE.                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE SPACES           TO PCIM-FILE-SCREEN.                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PF-KEY           TO PCIM-FILE-PFKEY.                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE D158700-REC  TO D158700-SAVE.                                                                                                                                                           
           INVOKE Self::"Input_To_Pcim_Data".                                                                                                                                                           
           MOVE D158700-CURSOR   TO PCIM-FILE-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE D158700-ATTR     TO PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES.                                                                                                                                               
           MOVE D158700-TEMP     TO PCIM-FILE-TEMP.                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE D158700-ERROR    TO PCIM-FILE-ERROR.                                                                                                                                                    
           INVOKE Self::"Set_Field_Received_Flag".                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE D158700-RECEIVED TO PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                 
       REFRESH-RETURN.                                                                                                                                                                                  
           SET PCIMCCLASS        TO NEW IdealRoutines.PCIMC                                                                                                                                             
           INVOKE PCIMCCLASS::PCIMCMETHOD(PCIM-FILE-AREA)                                                                                                                                               
           SET PCIMCCLASS        TO NULL                                                                                                                                                                
           IF PCIM-FILE-CODE = "E"                                                                                                                                                                      
             MOVE "LINKMENU.ASPX"  TO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                       
             SET NEXT-SCREEN       TO SCREEN-NAME::Trim                                                                                                                                                 
             INVOKE Self::Response::Redirect(NEXT-SCREEN)                                                                                                                                               
           ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                         
             IF PCIM-FILE-CODE = "T"                                                                                                                                                                    
               MOVE "TIMEOUT.ASPX"   TO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                     
               SET NEXT-SCREEN       TO SCREEN-NAME::Trim                                                                                                                                               
               INVOKE Self::Response::Redirect(NEXT-SCREEN)                                                                                                                                             
             ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                       
               IF PCIM-FILE-CODE = "C"                                                                                                                                                                  
                 MOVE SPACES        TO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                      
                 STRING PCIM-FILE-SCREEN   DELIMITED BY SPACE                                                                                                                                           
                       "CICSSTART.aspx"    DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                            
                       "?SESSION="         DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                            
                       THIS-SESSION-ALPHA  DELIMITED BY SPACE                                                                                                                                           
                       "&TRANCODE="        DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                            
                       PCIM-TRANCODE       DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                            
                       INTO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                                 
                 SET NEXT-SCREEN   TO SCREEN-NAME::Trim                                                                                                                                                 
                 INVOKE Self::Response::Redirect(NEXT-SCREEN).                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       REFRESH-ROUTINE.
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN = THIS-SCREEN-NAME 
              AND PCIM-FILE-REFRESH = 1                                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE THIS-SESSION     TO PCIM-FILE-KEY                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE "R"              TO PCIM-FILE-CODE                                                                                                                                                   
              MOVE SPACES           TO PCIM-FILE-SCREEN                                                                                                                                                 
              MOVE zeroes           TO PCIM-FILE-PFKEY                                                                                                                                                  
              INVOKE Self::"Load_Initial_Settings"                                                                                                                                                      
              MOVE SPACES            TO PCIM-FILE-CURSOR                                                                                                                                                
              MOVE SPACES            TO PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES                                                                                                                                            
              MOVE SPACES            TO PCIM-FILE-TEMP                                                                                                                                                  
              MOVE SPACES            TO PCIM-FILE-ERROR                                                                                                                                                 
              MOVE SPACES            TO PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED                                                                                                                                              
              MOVE zeroes           TO PCIM-FILE-REFRESH                                                                                                                                                
              GO TO REFRESH-RETURN.                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-DATA       TO D158700-REC.                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-CURSOR     TO D158700-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                 
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES TO D158700-ATTR.                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-TEMP       TO D158700-TEMP.                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ERROR      TO D158700-ERROR.                                                                                                                                                  
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED   TO D158700-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                               
           INVOKE Self::"Pcim_Data_To_Output".                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       end method From_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOGIC TO LOAD FIELDS TO THE SCREEN FOR DISPLAY                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       method-id.  To_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                                 
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * If not Post Back ...                                                                                                                                                                            
      *   If screen was redirected from another screen get the session                                                                                                                                  
      *   number from the screen query pair for "SESSION".                                                                                                                                              
      *    IF NOT Self::IsPostBack                                                                                                                                                                      
      *       MOVE SPACES TO REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION                                                                                                                                                    
      *       SET REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO Self::Request::QueryString::Item("SESSION")                                                                                                                
      *       IF REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                                   
      *          MOVE REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO THIS-SESSION-ALPHA.                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * If not Post Back ...                                                                                                                                                                            
      *   IF THIS IS A NEW SCREEN THEN READ THE PASSING FILE                                                                                                                                            
      *    IF NOT Self::IsPostBack                                                                                                                                                                      
      *       IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN NOT = THIS-SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                
      *           MOVE "R"          TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                 
      *           MOVE THIS-SESSION TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE SPACES       TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                
      *           MOVE ZERO         TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                 
      *           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                 
      *           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                           
      *           SET PASSINGFILECLASS   TO NULL                                                                                                                                                        
      *           MOVE PASS-SESSION-DATA TO PCIM-FILE-AREA                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-DATA       TO D158700-REC                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-CURSOR     TO D158700-CURSOR                                                                                                                                           
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES TO D158700-ATTR                                                                                                                                             
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-TEMP       TO D158700-TEMP                                                                                                                                             
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ERROR      TO D158700-ERROR                                                                                                                                            
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED   TO D158700-RECEIVED                                                                                                                                         
      *           INVOKE Self::"Pcim_Data_To_Output".                                                                                                                                                   
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * WRITE THE PASSING PARAMETERS TO THE PASSING FILE.                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE "W"            TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE THIS-SESSION   TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-AREA TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE ZERO           TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                      
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                                  
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NULL.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * PCIM-FILE-SCREEN contains the name of the screen to be displayed                                                                                                                                
      * If this is not this screen then redirect to the new screen.                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN NOT = SPACES AND THIS-SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                        
              MOVE SPACES        TO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                         
              STRING PCIM-FILE-SCREEN   DELIMITED BY SPACE                                                                                                                                              
                    ".aspx"             DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    "?SESSION="         DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    THIS-SESSION-ALPHA  DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    INTO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                                    
              SET NEXT-SCREEN   TO SCREEN-NAME::Trim                                                                                                                                                    
              INVOKE Self::Response::Redirect(NEXT-SCREEN).                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * DATA IS FOR THIS SCREEN                                                                                                                                                                         
      * SO SAVE A COPY OF THE SCREEN DATA FROM THE PROGRAM                                                                                                                                              
      * LOAD THE SCREEN FIELDS                                                                                                                                                                          
      * AND SEND THE SCREEN TO THE TERMINAL                                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Set_Screen_Cursor".                                                                                                                                                            
           INVOKE Self::"Load_Screen".                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET THE FIELD ATTRIBUTES IF ANY HAVE BEEN MODOIFIED                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Modify_Attributes".                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       end method To_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SUBROUTINES                                                                                                                                                                                     
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOAD SCREEN WITH VALUES FROM PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                            
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Load_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                               
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           set S_ACTION::Text                           to O-ACTION::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                           
           set S_DATE_R::Text                           to O-DATE-R::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                           
           set S_SEL1::Text                             to O-SEL1::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                             
           set S_SEL2::Text                             to O-SEL2::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                             
           set S_SEL3::Text                             to O-SEL3::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                             
           set S_SEL4::Text                             to O-SEL4::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                             
           set S_SEL5::Text                             to O-SEL5::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                             
           set S_PF1::Text                              to O-PF1::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                              
           set S_PF3::Text                              to O-PF3::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                              
           set S_PF6::Text                              to O-PF6::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                              
           set S_PF12::Text                             to O-PF12::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                             
           set S_ERR_MSG::Text                          to O-ERR-MSG::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                          
           set CPOSN2::Text                             to CURSOR-POSITION-2.                                                                                                                           
           set UCTSESSION::Value                        to THIS-SESSION-ALPHA.                                                                                                                          
           set ACT::Text                                to "1".                                                                                                                                         
       end method Load_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * UNLOAD SCREEN VALUES TO PASS TO PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                         
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Unload_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                             
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           set I-ACTION                                 to S_ACTION::Text.
           set I-ACTION                                 to function upper-case(I-ACTION).
           if I-ACTION = "so"
               set I-ACTION to "SO"
           else if I-ACTION = "So"
               set I-ACTION to "SO"
           else if I-ACTION = "sO"
               set I-ACTION to "SO"
           end-if                                                                                                                                         
           set I-DATE-R                                 to S_DATE_R::Text.                                                                                                                              
           set I-SEL1                                   to S_SEL1::Text.
           set I-SEL1                                   to function upper-case(I-SEL1).                                                                                                                                
           set I-SEL2                                   to S_SEL2::Text.
           set I-SEL2                                   to function upper-case(I-SEL2).                                                                                                                                
           set I-SEL3                                   to S_SEL3::Text.
           set I-SEL3                                   to function upper-case(I-SEL3).                                                                                                                                
           set I-SEL4                                   to S_SEL4::Text.
           set I-SEL4                                   to function upper-case(I-SEL4).                                                                                                                                
           set I-SEL5                                   to S_SEL5::Text.
           set I-SEL5                                   to function upper-case(I-SEL5).                                                                                                                                
           set I-PF1                                    to S_PF1::Text.                                                                                                                                 
           set I-PF3                                    to S_PF3::Text.                                                                                                                                 
           set I-PF6                                    to S_PF6::Text.                                                                                                                                 
           set I-PF12                                   to S_PF12::Text.                                                                                                                                
           set I-ERR-MSG                                to S_ERR_MSG::Text.                                                                                                                             
           set THIS-SESSION-ALPHA                       to UCTSESSION::Value.                                                                                                                           
           set PF-KEYIN                                 to KEYPRESS::Value.                                                                                                                             
           set SCREEN-CURSOR                            to CPOSN::Value.                                                                                                                                
           set CURSOR-POSITION TO Type Convert::ToInt32(SCREEN-CURSOR).                                                                                                                                 
       end method Unload_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOAD SCREEN WITH FIELD ATTRIBUTES FROM PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Modify_Attributes protected.                                                                                                                                                         
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           IF ACTION-ATTR NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                                                  
              MOVE ZERO TO UCT-COUNT                                                                                                                                                                    
              INSPECT ACTION-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "U"                                                                                                                                        
              INSPECT ACTION-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "C"                                                                                                                                        
              IF UCT-COUNT > 0                                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_ACTION::ReadOnly to False                                                                                                                                                        
                 set S_ACTION::BackColor to type System.Drawing.Color::White                                                                                                                            
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE ZERO TO UCT-COUNT                                                                                                                                                                    
              INSPECT ACTION-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "P"                                                                                                                                        
              IF UCT-COUNT > 0                                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_ACTION::ReadOnly to True                                                                                                                                                         
                 set S_ACTION::BackColor to type System.Drawing.Color::LightGray                                                                                                                        
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              IF ACTION-ATTR(1:3) = "UAH"                                                                                                                                                               
                 set S_ACTION::BorderColor to type System.Drawing.Color::Red                                                                                                                            
                 set S_ACTION::BorderStyle to type System.Web.UI.WebControls.BorderStyle::Solid                                                                                                         
              ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                      
                 set S_ACTION::BorderColor to type System.Drawing.Color::White                                                                                                                          
                 set S_ACTION::BorderStyle to type System.Web.UI.WebControls.BorderStyle::NotSet                                                                                                        
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
           END-IF.                                                                                                                                                                                      
           IF SEL1-ATTR NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE ZERO TO UCT-COUNT                                                                                                                                                                    
              INSPECT SEL1-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "U"                                                                                                                                          
              INSPECT SEL1-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "C"                                                                                                                                          
              IF UCT-COUNT > 0                                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_SEL1::ReadOnly to False                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_SEL1::BackColor to type System.Drawing.Color::White                                                                                                                              
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE ZERO TO UCT-COUNT                                                                                                                                                                    
              INSPECT SEL1-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "P"                                                                                                                                          
              IF UCT-COUNT > 0                                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_SEL1::ReadOnly to True                                                                                                                                                           
                 set S_SEL1::BackColor to type System.Drawing.Color::LightGray                                                                                                                          
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              IF SEL1-ATTR(1:3) = "UAH"                                                                                                                                                                 
                 set S_SEL1::BorderColor to type System.Drawing.Color::Red                                                                                                                              
                 set S_SEL1::BorderStyle to type System.Web.UI.WebControls.BorderStyle::Solid                                                                                                           
              ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                      
                 set S_SEL1::BorderColor to type System.Drawing.Color::White                                                                                                                            
                 set S_SEL1::BorderStyle to type System.Web.UI.WebControls.BorderStyle::NotSet                                                                                                          
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
           END-IF.                                                                                                                                                                                      
           IF SEL2-ATTR NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE ZERO TO UCT-COUNT                                                                                                                                                                    
              INSPECT SEL2-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "U"                                                                                                                                          
              INSPECT SEL2-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "C"                                                                                                                                          
              IF UCT-COUNT > 0                                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_SEL2::ReadOnly to False                                                                                                                                                          
                 set S_SEL2::BackColor to type System.Drawing.Color::White                                                                                                                              
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE ZERO TO UCT-COUNT                                                                                                                                                                    
              INSPECT SEL2-ATTR TALLYING UCT-COUNT FOR ALL "P"                                                                                                                                          
              IF UCT-COUNT > 0                                                                                                                                                                          
